          </tei:f>
        </tei:fs>
      </j:conditional>
      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="notes">
        <tei:p>This prayer of the guest chaplain was offered in the fifth month of the first session of the 85th US Congress in the House of Representatives, and published in the <tei:hi rend="italic">Congressional Record</tei:hi>, vol. 103, part 6 (28 May 1957), page 7889. The prayer was offered immediately before Konrad Adenauer, Chancelor of the Federal Republic of Germany, addressed the House chamber.</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
